# Outreach tooling is tracked; the data it operates on is not.
# A public repo must never carry the prospect list (a competitor's shortcut),
# the addresses of people who opted out, or the record of who we mailed.
outreach/prospects.csv
outreach/prospects-notes.md
outreach/batches/
outreach/sample-cache.json
outreach/contacted.csv
outreach/sent.log
outreach/suppressed.txt

# Every prospect list, whatever the suffix, and the nurture log.
outreach/prospects*.csv
outreach/nurture.log

# LinkedIn: the day packs, tracker, events and renders name real agencies and
# stay on this machine. The tools that read and write them are code, and tracked.
outreach/linkedin/*
!outreach/linkedin/today.mjs
!outreach/linkedin/board.mjs
!outreach/linkedin/board.html
!outreach/linkedin/board.cmd

# State of the scheduled jobs: message ids, addresses, the Companies House download.
ops/.cache/
